+  // UIWindowSceneDelegate callback. We don't conform to that protocol in
+  // Rust — the obj-c runtime only checks respondsToSelector, so an inherent
+  // method registered via `#[unsafe(method(…))]` is enough. Fired by iPadOS
+  // when the scene's coordinate space changes (Stage Manager drag, split
